<human_speech><blue>This one is about supply, not fighting. You have one shipyard and one ship. The enemy has a wall of fortresses.<\blue><green>A fortress produces nothing. The yard produces everything, and it flips to any lone visitor. Guard yours; think about theirs.<\green><blue>Build first. Fight when you have more than it does.<\blue><green>Wasting cognition time on the wall.<\green><\human_speech>
